{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32713f291e33d839a8a630361512b4f735005b05aa89e334d43337927a66f17e", "ja": "（桃子の新しい衣装は、着物風のデザインだ。\nブログでは、結構気に入ってるみたいだったけど……）", "zh": "（桃子的新服装是走和服风格。\n她在部落格写说很喜欢的样子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b10c133f960834c3788f73b86b4d3f529826e44d38ed6c6a5dca93c730db4b3f", "ja": "桃子、入ってもいいか？\n……桃子？", "zh": "桃子，我方便进去吗？\n……桃子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "f741c12042cb15e259952c6ca3cf42c0a87e74459f0bb559248393b3635a06a1", "ja": "うん。着物っぽいけど、ちゃんとかわいい。\nお兄ちゃん、けっこうやるじゃない！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "嗯，虽然很像和服，但确实很可爱。\n大哥哥还挺厉害的嘛！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3dad4d212d767d48e6edc031d023f10fc3be5ebf13ae812468316b14d31e4e57", "ja": "おっ、そうか？　ありがとう！\n本当に気に入ったんだな、良かった。", "zh": "哦，是吗？谢谢你啊！\n看来你真的很喜欢，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "c14cdd0f8ea3229a07c832d88de0d4bbc7e21b04768c9a92b579267ad5e09c68", "ja": "えっ？　……お、お兄ちゃん！？\nもう、急に入ってこないで！　ビックリするでしょ！", "zh": "咦？……大、大哥哥！？\n讨厌，你不要突然进来啦！桃子会吓到的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "afdc1e6a9892fd5f44008c7dfb0651163f6342f75d58007d2a1d9fbced0e2c88", "ja": "だいたい、ちゃんと声掛けしないで入ってくるなんて、\n信じられない！　デリカシーが足りないよ！", "zh": "而且，你居然没先说一声就进来，\n真是不敢相信！神经太大条了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1006_p", "source_sha256": "509d2b708b31c240845d59ade75512b38b48351861322b7f76aecb5ef5b8bfc3", "ja": "いや、一応声は掛けたんだけど……。", "zh": "呃，我是有先问过的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "b25f1420ce94e72ee7760f322cce6232e28454eecc0943abbbf404dc2316fe53", "ja": "桃子が気づいてなかったら、意味ないでしょ！\nやり直し！", "zh": "桃子没注意到的话，不就没有意义吗！\n重来一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4b79820d0dd2848349ac4565eddc620630593bd6c6edf859449e502ccb38f704", "ja": "ご、ごめん。じゃあもう1回……\n『桃子、入ってもいいか？』", "zh": "抱、抱歉。那再来一次……\n『桃子，我方便进去吗？』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "41b275f67ceaadc53d1214a05082abcd44ab31b3a3c04ac422dc16ba45b369b7", "ja": "うん、素直でよろしい♪\n『はい、どうぞ！　入っていいよ、お兄ちゃん♪』", "zh": "嗯，真乖真听话♪\n『嗯，请进！现在方便唷，大哥哥♪』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "d69d25640bec037e9f69e8bc2b4b0e2c222c8c6899d3914964a23e3432ad164f", "ja": "いい？　こうやってOK出されてからじゃないと、\n女の子の部屋には入っちゃダメなんだからね？", "zh": "懂了吗？一定要像这样先取得许可，\n千万不能擅自进到女生的房间喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d9a697f67847fe9f221b1b57890bc941912f99806f7fda919658d4071ab75f06", "ja": "肝に銘じます……。", "zh": "我会谨记在心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "3452ae75831dc312d58604a5aadcb8cbbc684519c410a8e203f1d7f5ba700844", "ja": "わかったならいいんだよ。\n先輩の話は、素直に聞かないとね♪", "zh": "你明白就好。\n前辈的话就要好好听♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "3104469d0473275658277979013bfe0d9fedc93d614fd210e9c6b07e14c3a34b", "ja": "ところでお兄ちゃん、何の用？\n桃子、今、衣装のチェックで忙しいんだけど。", "zh": "话说大哥哥，有什么事吗？\n桃子现在正忙着检查服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8ab7e895ef0d6ad2f137e511475bcd9a096ef682cc3a4bde79a5bac4948b0418", "ja": "いや、その衣装の事で来たんだ。\n青羽さんから、気になるところはないかって。", "zh": "呃，我就是为了服装的事来的。\n青羽小姐要我问你服装有没有哪里在意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "e32d73d5b3e181aca1723dae9aff860c713cd42f99b9a38de680eb67529bf417", "ja": "青羽さんが？\nもう、そんなの桃子に直接聞けばいいのに……。", "zh": "青羽姊在问？\n哎唷，她直接问桃子不就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1016_p", "source_sha256": "373ec4657f074dd2b167cc896ec575abc2661777dd5729de6dc4aaafd22bc1df", "ja": "桃子が忙しそうだったから、\n邪魔したら悪いと思ったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "她应该是看桃子很忙，\n才觉得不好意思打扰你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "bad99b40278c9c27a900abe81e89c0c1b2997c0d45d8ca326faa7d00a5860710", "ja": "そっか、大人の気遣いだね。\nそれに比べて、お兄ちゃんときたら……。", "zh": "原来是大人的体贴呀。\n相较之下，大哥哥就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1018_p", "source_sha256": "100d625745524593fc4bece3abf0bb481fee088ed0aa764bd92a7f167af54ed7", "ja": "ま、まあまあ……。\nそれで、どうだ？　気になるところはないか？", "zh": "放、放过我啦……\n所以你觉得如何？有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "dacac3a5a29324bf830cbbf0b15815ed51cb14286e249592a9d8b400b95679a2", "ja": "ううん、全然オッケーだよ！　問題なし。\n青羽さんに、ありがとうって言っておいて♪", "zh": "没有，非常OK喔！没有任何问题。\n帮桃子跟青羽姊说声谢谢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1020_p", "source_sha256": "adc6661c124c8b042b6dac9564a1cd7b1eb7ffc90c5ce0d00e0ccdc7a1b40849", "ja": "それは、桃子が自分で言った方がいいんじゃないか？\n青羽さん、喜ぶと思うよ。", "zh": "还是桃子亲口跟她说比较好吧？\n我想青羽小姐一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1021_049mom", "source_sha256": "0ae2dcaccf878f7b90886a25cccd068e487385ceaf50a85d98644559f0152fde", "ja": "も、桃子が？　でも……。", "zh": "桃、桃子亲口？可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a730e5ed40cb42c761c2fb698c4942d082d36e2bbe05b8c78c2c5c9e1b246a27", "ja": "俺は、桃子がこの衣装を喜んでくれてるのがわかって、\n嬉しかったからな。青羽さんも同じだと思うよ。", "zh": "知道桃子很中意这套服装，\n我觉得很开心，我想青羽小姐一定也会的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1023_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c0f2917fec7208ab971b270c63136f5fcb8a1cf2de80f8a611d84468e6c1f02", "ja": "そっか……うん、そうだよね。わかった。\n桃子、お礼言ってくる。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，说得也是，桃子知道了。\n桃子，这就去跟她道谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1024_049mom", "source_sha256": "c722f97ee8084e82f502f145a37a51cafa2045f6488921328e1f84fb6c264923", "ja": "あっ……でも、その前に……。\nお、お兄ちゃん。", "zh": "啊……不过在那之前……\n大、大哥哥。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1025_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_049mom0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_049mom0074_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "6a5a7b230497294a220718d67540ecad03736ca35506673633547f095ed6982c", "ja": "この衣装、お兄ちゃんも一緒に考えてくれたんでしょ？\nだから……ありがと。桃子、気に入ってるから。", "zh": "大哥哥也有一起构思这套服装对吧？\n所以……谢谢你，桃子很喜欢这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
